    "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hanselime/paqet/tarball/v1.0.0-alpha.21",
    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hanselime/paqet/zipball/v1.0.0-alpha.21",
    "body": "> [!WARNING]\r\n> This release includes breaking changes to the protocol and is not backward compatible with previous versions.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* internal/conf: fix nil pointer dereferences by @HoomanDevp in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/96\r\n* build(deps): bump github.com/xtaci/kcp-go/v5 from 5.6.64 to 5.6.72 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/120\r\n* build(deps): bump actions/setup-go from 6 to 7 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/148\r\n* build(deps): bump actions/stale from 10 to 11 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/149\r\n* build(deps): bump golang.org/x/crypto from 0.53.0 to 0.54.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/143\r\n* build(deps): bump github.com/gopacket/gopacket from 1.6.1 to 1.7.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/144\r\n* internal/protocol: add length-prefixed framing to wire format by @hanselime in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/146\r\n* internal/forward: decouple udp writes from the read loop by @hanselime in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/147\r\n* internal/buffer: replace io.CopyBuffer with explicit bounded copies by @hanselime in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/150\r\n* internal/client: expire idle udp strms from the pool by @hanselime in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/151\r\n* internal/socks: debug log truncated udp datagrams at the read by @hanselime in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/152\r\n* internal/forward: allocate udp handoff buffers to size by @hanselime in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/153\r\n* internal/forward: halve the udp session queue by @hanselime in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/154\r\n* internal: use context.AfterFunc for shutdown hooks by @hanselime in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/155\r\n* internal/tnet/kcp: enable kcp stream mode by @hanselime in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/156\r\n* internal/conf: lower default client sndwnd by @hanselime in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/157\r\n* internal/socket: disable promiscuous mode by @hanselime in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/158\r\n* internal/socket: filter out input on send handle by @hanselime in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/159\r\n* internal/socket: decode packets into reused layer structs by @hanselime in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/160\r\n* internal/socket: encode packets into reused layer structs by @hanselime in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/161\r\n* internal/socket: check deadlines without timer alloc by @hanselime in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/162\r\n* internal/socket: size pcap handles per role by @hanselime in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/163\r\n* internal/flog: rework logger and normalize log messages by @hanselime in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/166\r\n* internal/forward: drop full-queue datagrams before copy by @hanselime in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/165\r\n* internal/socket: read packets from pcap buffer by @hanselime in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/164\r\n* build(deps): bump github.com/gopacket/gopacket from 1.7.0 to 1.7.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/167\r\n* build(deps): bump golang.org/x/crypto from 0.54.0 to 0.55.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/168\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @HoomanDevp made their first contribution in https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/pull/96\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/hanselime/paqet/compare/v1.0.0-alpha.20...v1.0.0-alpha.21",
